    },
    {
      "key": "0129c99",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_boat_people",
      "sourceText": "يحتوي هذا القارب على نوافذ كبيرة. يمكن للسياح الاستمتاع بمشاهدة المدينة. إنه \"قارب نهري\".",
      "sourceEnText": "This boat has large windows. Tourists can admire the city. It's a \"riverboat\".",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_0129c99.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "haytham",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 8516,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T22:50:15Z",
      "textHash": "35295525189ca15c300fee75f0cd8521f30b408eeedc40c5681a5388a9df3de7"
    },
    {
      "key": "0165157",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_boat_house",
      "sourceText": "لماذا يُطلق على هذا القارب اسم \"القارب السكني\"؟",
      "sourceEnText": "Why is this boat called a houseboat?",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_0165157.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "haytham",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 3213,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T22:50:10Z",
      "textHash": "0ef2bb47202e1f08e1e01b14de4aab55546f8b60faa7d5bb2ad92fe6b4131677"
    },
    {
      "key": "01663fa",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_train",
      "sourceText": "أتمنى بشدة أن أركب القطار!",
      "sourceEnText": "I would love to ride a train!",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_01663fa.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "haytham",
      "actorId": "ADULT_M",
      "durationMs": 2299,
