    {
      "key": "066d7bd",
      "nodeTitle": "question_seine_map",
      "sourceText": "يُطلق على النهر الذي يمر عبر باريس اسم...",
      "sourceEnText": "The river that flows through Paris is called...",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_066d7bd.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "haytham",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 3500,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T22:49:42Z",
      "textHash": "dcc9b58be4cdb36b7f81982f08e4932f55edbc93c4a08c5b9f6224253a324829"
    },
    {
      "key": "06aa0c1",
      "nodeTitle": "spawned_french_man",
      "sourceText": "أهلاً!",
      "sourceEnText": "Hi!",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_06aa0c1.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "haytham",
      "actorId": "ADULT_M",
      "durationMs": 758,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T22:51:09Z",
      "textHash": "6752b6a0e0ecc52ea5d2517b0f6f07ac2a4abce6df679690e42469da5d146a8f"
    },
    {
      "key": "06d2470",
      "nodeTitle": "spawned_river_friend",
      "sourceText": "تُظهر الخرائط منعطفات النهر.",
      "sourceEnText": "The maps show the meanders of the river.",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_06d2470.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "haytham",
      "actorId": "ADULT_F",
      "durationMs": 2560,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T22:51:21Z",
      "textHash": "b29db200c4ef6f4ca0159475b042cb1f0507202b21a5cc9952e78de6f8690eed"
    },
    {
      "key": "072a345",
      "nodeTitle": "spawned_french_woman",
      "sourceText": "صباح الخير!",
      "sourceEnText": "Good morning!",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_072a345.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "haytham",
      "actorId": "ADULT_F",
      "durationMs": 1358,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T22:51:05Z",
      "textHash": "edfb19bf89ca0be81996589d909bf8108d2ffb2d79945e575dc1ee8ae519b8d1"
    },
    {
      "key": "074efa5",
      "nodeTitle": "facts_river",
      "sourceText": "يصب نهر السين في القناة الإنجليزية.",
      "sourceEnText": "The Seine flows into the English Channel.",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_074efa5.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "haytham",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 3500,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T22:51:04Z",
      "textHash": "b232fb00292fa37e49959e26d599dbbdf259e67fedfa4a5673e179b997365539"
    },
    {
      "key": "076ee7f",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_bridge_cars",
      "sourceText": "يمكنك عبور الطريق من أي مكان.",
      "sourceEnText": "You can cross the road anywhere.",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_076ee7f.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "haytham",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 2429,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T22:50:34Z",
      "textHash": "6a9faebc32d01e45de02f228df5638f921db383e5a912d8b3302521d0b1f4238"
    },
    {
      "key": "07cac48",
      "nodeTitle": "protagonist",
      "sourceText": "لقد وجدت جميع الصور من دليلي!",
      "sourceEnText": "You found all the photos from my guide!",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_07cac48.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "haytham",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 2612,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T22:49:24Z",
      "textHash": "6dce5ff8338f2db9abcc3301f03b1c277b62c8d91d9528d78431d245ed72ceb8"
    },
    {
      "key": "07f732f",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_bridge_people",
      "sourceText": "جسر للسيارات",
      "sourceEnText": "a bridge for cars",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_07f732f.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "haytham",
      "actorId": "ADULT_M",
      "durationMs": 1463,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T22:50:51Z",
      "textHash": "6af03aad1de5232cc027b95a231f548c07d3e9be49fb41decae3928e48749299"
    },
    {
      "key": "0816b6b",
      "nodeTitle": "spawned_bridge_expert",
      "sourceText": "يجب أن يكون جسر القطار قوياً.",
      "sourceEnText": "A train bridge must be strong.",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_0816b6b.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "haytham",
      "actorId": "ADULT_M",
      "durationMs": 2612,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T22:51:15Z",
      "textHash": "20691600dac04332d0cc99aaabe8f78d0278112a7d6d58c6cdab4e04639a1e89"
    },
    {
      "key": "084c7e4",
      "nodeTitle": "protagonist",
      "sourceText": "تنزه على ضفاف نهر السين وابحث عن الصور!",
      "sourceEnText": "Take a walk along the banks of the Seine and find the photos!",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_084c7e4.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "haytham",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 3788,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T22:49:28Z",
      "textHash": "810c667bd16561582f4ac7c8ec27e40f95af44c87f87fd3a0f0a606e375fce6d"
    },
    {
      "key": "08b0aea",
      "nodeTitle": "protagonist",
      "sourceText": "أخيرًا أستطيع العودة إلى المنزل! لدي سؤال أخير…",
      "sourceEnText": "I can finally go home! I have one last question…",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_08b0aea.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "haytham",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 4571,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T22:49:26Z",
      "textHash": "97cd9562e047dc7032fd1ee2c1111bcf17fa7acc5a51cc3db2b2388f99882722"
    },
    {
      "key": "08b1177",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_seine_map",
      "sourceText": "انظر إلى هذه الخريطة لنهر السين.",
      "sourceEnText": "Look at this map of the Seine.",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_08b1177.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "haytham",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 2194,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T22:50:53Z",
      "textHash": "ed963b2a721f812ef90d55d64606d562c6919fa3a3026fdb5bfe1eeaf862019e"
    },
    {
      "key": "08b4fad",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_bridge_train",
      "sourceText": "للسيارات",
      "sourceEnText": "for cars",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_08b4fad.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "haytham",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 1123,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T22:50:41Z",
      "textHash": "93af99c55bbf09b4646771e76b0bfaa6e6eed59d816a63cfa71f16de486c41d2"
    },
    {
      "key": "08cc02a",
      "nodeTitle": "quest_end",
      "sourceText": "تم بناء المعالم الأثرية الهامة في باريس حول نهر السين.",
      "sourceEnText": "Important monuments in Paris were built around the Seine.",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_08cc02a.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "haytham",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 4101,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T22:49:20Z",
      "textHash": "57359d86300546905cf079771c2aad70caee9967215a8fe8254c4672fc1a948b"
    },
    {
      "key": "08d8ef0",
      "nodeTitle": "spawned_bridge_expert",
      "sourceText": "تعبر السيارات النهر كل يوم.",
      "sourceEnText": "Cars cross the river every day.",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_08d8ef0.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "haytham",
      "actorId": "ADULT_M",
      "durationMs": 2194,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T22:51:18Z",
      "textHash": "ba23947f6b0170d22080578be265cb29e91f30d4bd9e5b6f9406763fbb4776e1"
    },
    {
      "key": "091e9fc",
      "nodeTitle": "quest_end",
      "sourceText": "لقد اكتشفت جسور وقوارب نهر السين. تتيح لك الجسور عبور النهر الذي يمر عبر باريس: نهر السين.",
      "sourceEnText": "You discovered the bridges and boats of the Seine. The bridges allow you to cross the river that flows through Paris: the Seine.",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_091e9fc.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "haytham",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 9482,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T22:49:15Z",
      "textHash": "bb03be6e8e95183e18eca58451f267bf0c12c34b0b22534f34a97c448d575bb9"
    },
    {
      "key": "09731f9",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_bridge_train",
      "sourceText": "جسر القطار هو جسر...",
      "sourceEnText": "A train bridge is a bridge...",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_09731f9.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "haytham",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 1776,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T22:50:38Z",
      "textHash": "ac3382410c2a551e8c120e76a9f33fadfd0946894b94174d3b5243c17209ceff"
    },
    {
      "key": "099fe86",
      "nodeTitle": "question_seine_map",
      "sourceText": "هذا ليس الجواب الصحيح. يمر نهر اللوار عبر مدينة نانت، بالقرب من متحف جول فيرن.",
      "sourceEnText": "That's not the correct answer. The Loire flows through Nantes, near the Jules Verne Museum.",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_099fe86.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "haytham",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 7863,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T22:49:44Z",
      "textHash": "49ee173154d361af642909fd8a2089e43ab2ea4a8dcb761ade539b3ae75c164d"
    },
    {
      "key": "09c706f",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_bridge_alexandre",
      "sourceText": "هذا هو جسر ألكسندر الثالث. إنه جسر مشهور جداً.",
      "sourceEnText": "This is the Alexander III Bridge. It's a very famous bridge.",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_09c706f.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "haytham",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 4885,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T22:50:22Z",
      "textHash": "94392f377b332657637274cc19409adbe2cd6dbd5cd86c5fe0191b5e90724d14"
    },
    {
      "key": "09f3f7a",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_boat",
      "sourceText": "كلب؟ هناك العديد من الكلاب هنا...",
      "sourceEnText": "A dog? There are many dogs here...",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_09f3f7a.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "haytham",
      "actorId": "ADULT_M",
      "durationMs": 2664,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T22:50:57Z",
      "textHash": "f23242c1f380066276eb0ee4567a952538c6eb0c1a6aa76cc013722f7be30228"
    },
    {
      "key": "0a0991d",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_bridge_train",
      "sourceText": "إنه جسر للقطارات!",
      "sourceEnText": "It's a bridge for trains!",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_0a0991d.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "haytham",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 1881,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T22:50:37Z",
      "textHash": "b2da1af8984745b46886544a387425368a6f49c46ca8ffb1e13adf385d335d9b"
    },
    {
      "key": "0a29742",
      "nodeTitle": "quest_end",
      "sourceText": "توجد قوارب سكنية. يعيش الناس على هذه القوارب. وتسمى هذه القوارب بالبارجات.",
      "sourceEnText": "There are houseboats. People live on these boats. They are called barges.",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_0a29742.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "haytham",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 7628,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T22:49:19Z",
      "textHash": "df0118f1a1e83273a4c1dc3ce8c3bce4e08f77cdb5b1b1af8829e9cf588cd527"
    },
    {
      "key": "0a2bcd3",
      "nodeTitle": "question_seine_map",
      "sourceText": "نعم، إنه نهر السين. النهر الذي يمر عبر باريس يُسمى نهر السين.",
      "sourceEnText": "Yes, it's the Seine. The river that flows through Paris is called the Seine.",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_0a2bcd3.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "haytham",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 6531,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T22:49:47Z",
      "textHash": "ef7e42f8b58ffb0b7c3d00aeeac6ddb71ac419fec645dd01075badbfbc57d277"
    },
    {
      "key": "0a627c2",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_boat_house",
      "sourceText": "هذا القارب منزل. هناك أناس يعيشون على هذا القارب. يُطلق على هذا القارب اسم \"القارب السكني\".",
      "sourceEnText": "This boat is a house. There are people who live on this boat. This boat is called a houseboat.",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_0a627c2.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "haytham",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 7784,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T22:50:08Z",
      "textHash": "f1e72146c12faff95fae8159b78864e134cee4d8d00285a4c0a355b97c85e006"
    },
    {
      "key": "0a70250",
      "nodeTitle": "protagonist",
      "sourceText": "شكرًا لك!",
      "sourceEnText": "Thank you!",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_0a70250.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "haytham",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 1280,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T22:49:23Z",
      "textHash": "0a9fd5e9edad234ab772c477c11b2bdf085ba09aaaa55db2cecd8abe94e2eac6"
    },
    {
      "key": "0a9c8e7",
      "nodeTitle": "protagonist",
      "sourceText": "امشِ بالقرب من النهر وستجد الصور!",
      "sourceEnText": "Walk near the river and you'll find the photos!",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_0a9c8e7.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "haytham",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 2717,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T22:49:37Z",
      "textHash": "517da90d228dbbf12b28b13eaf56bbddc11710128c605e961ed9cf591e454654"
    },
    {
      "key": "0aa0f3a",
      "nodeTitle": "protagonist",
      "sourceText": "النجدة! أنقذوني!",
      "sourceEnText": "Help! Help me!",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_0aa0f3a.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "haytham",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 1881,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T22:49:33Z",
      "textHash": "7a51e327ea3ffc9162889ff4aa1f071a05c74cd315000cf412981bad43bae6a1"
    },
    {
      "key": "0b12cb3",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_boat_goods",
      "sourceText": "يمكن لسفينة البضائع أن تنقل: الخشب والرمل، ولكن أيضاً الأشياء: السيارات والأثاث...",
      "sourceEnText": "Boxes and things",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_0b12cb3.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "haytham",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 7993,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T22:49:53Z",
      "textHash": "993835a6e986ed9c5016a8672e796b3fe6be73954f1d696b9efb8044245d4297"
    },
    {
      "key": "0b37e92",
      "nodeTitle": "post_quest_activity",
      "sourceText": "ارسم جسراً في دفتر ملاحظاتك!",
      "sourceEnText": "Draw a bridge in your notebook!",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_0b37e92.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "haytham",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 2482,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T22:49:21Z",
      "textHash": "fe16bb2cd3c89b30b2c3634e6b426567805ed4dad146e82f3247c29170cc3c23"
    },
    {
      "key": "0ba2f29",
      "nodeTitle": "spawned_bridge_expert",
      "sourceText": "بعض الجسور مخصصة للمشاة فقط.",
      "sourceEnText": "Some bridges are intended for pedestrians only.",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_0ba2f29.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "haytham",
      "actorId": "ADULT_M",
      "durationMs": 2560,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T22:51:16Z",
      "textHash": "83f8620a38f75329a609a31cdb167e8650472ce53db3ca51001cd4cbddeb6962"
    },
    {
      "key": "0bbd3ce",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_boat_goods",
      "sourceText": "سياح يحملون كاميرات",
      "sourceEnText": "Tourists with cameras",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_0bbd3ce.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "haytham",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 2194,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T22:49:56Z",
      "textHash": "f9b88ba0e765de4335560c8c0d713beee32e3b04712d5802f3f5da51db8ed57b"
    },
    {
      "key": "0bfcb05",
      "nodeTitle": "protagonist",
      "sourceText": "إذا لم تتمكن من العثور عليهم، يمكنك استخدام خريطة باريس لتحديد موقعهم!",
      "sourceEnText": "If you can't find them, you can use the map of Paris to locate them!",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_0bfcb05.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "haytham",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 6478,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T22:49:30Z",
      "textHash": "84c2a9a218280e27290414ebb84568878b971b23f1d496ef1f64072d46244d8e"
    },
    {
      "key": "0c408c3",
      "nodeTitle": "quest_end",
      "sourceText": "ممتاز، لقد أكملت هذه المهمة!",
      "sourceEnText": "Great, you've completed this quest!",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_0c408c3.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "haytham",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 2612,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T22:49:13Z",
      "textHash": "77e4535304be750c0812ad0d27a4e4adec3d323b226dbf2e743bea0861344f28"
    },
    {
      "key": "0c86d26",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_boat_house",
      "sourceText": "من الممكن العيش هناك.",
      "sourceEnText": "It's possible to live there.",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_0c86d26.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "haytham",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 1881,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T22:50:11Z",
      "textHash": "8933abfff2672da1abc5182f8da93d0c1e11970af281d0ff9d0467b456caa914"
    },
    {
      "key": "0c8cdae",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_bridge_cars",
      "sourceText": "يجب عليك السير على الرصيف والعبور من ممر المشاة.",
      "sourceEnText": "Use the sidewalk and cross at the crossing",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_0c8cdae.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "haytham",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 4336,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T22:50:32Z",
      "textHash": "7f2bdab01260f3529779c0d8ee0213eeb5110965d5f0c70bb865f81104b26fba"
    },
    {
      "key": "0c8e7b6",
      "nodeTitle": "protagonist",
      "sourceText": "سقطت صفحات كتابي والصور بالقرب من نهر السين!",
      "sourceEnText": "The pages of my book and the photos fell near the Seine!",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_0c8e7b6.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "haytham",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 3918,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T22:49:36Z",
      "textHash": "04695a05bc63d26b82e65909b0ea996f2612944a8652c28f1a4e5d314fe4d584"
    },
    {
      "key": "0cf371b",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_bridge_cars",
      "sourceText": "عليك أن تمشي على الطريق",
      "sourceEnText": "You have to walk on the road",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_0cf371b.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "haytham",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 1698,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T22:50:35Z",
      "textHash": "87ec9fe7520e3dd92109a48baee1f82aa43b6f02f154df57edfe9bab7bf0d884"
    },
    {
      "key": "0d1724c",
      "nodeTitle": "spawned_river_friend",
      "sourceText": "يصب النهر في البحر.",
      "sourceEnText": "The river flows into the sea.",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_0d1724c.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "haytham",
      "actorId": "ADULT_F",
      "durationMs": 1646,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T22:51:22Z",
      "textHash": "dad2245ef5549ff4844b3e0280d522e5fd56ceb7b58b531c1a2941a6ec4eb6c3"
    },
    {
      "key": "0d79d7d",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_bridge_cars",
      "sourceText": "إنه جسر للسيارات!",
      "sourceEnText": "It's a bridge for cars!",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_0d79d7d.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "haytham",
      "actorId": "Default",
